+# VBS isolation review support: the stated isolation fields, the /probe.ko hook, the VBS report probe.
+# All runs here: QEMU/KVM on warden-host, NOT Hyper-V. Nothing here has run on a VBS-isolated (type 1) partition.
+
+## pins
+production initrd 0d14db231b1485bfde352d9043437d27459278361153802e0fa42314732e67e1 (build-domain.sh, rebuilt byte-identical)
+box UKI (WSL kernel 7fe3edb5 + 0d14db23)  7af57aabbe5d8b5533892734a6cb8947085bad13dfdd89b918e2436cccd66f4a
+PROBE initrd (0d14db23 + /probe.ko)       574ce802997b353979de7ed98deea8618a20c21ac196b04506a17c70c968da0e  NOT a production medium
+PROBE UKI                                 f6ebbc0ee473cfddc9523b9bb7b879b0869a4dfb379366e57a0a005a7d2c6cba  NOT a production medium
+vbsreport.ko                              447af5ceb0bc7f45100e6fc869f70094154ee112bf145b348c502b4d83506d49 (WSL tag linux-msft-wsl-6.6.87.2, IKCONFIG of 7fe3edb5, gcc 16.2.1)
+
+## monitor unit tests
+--- PASS: TestHvIsolationFields (0.00s)
+    hvisolation_test.go:36: this machine: hyperv=false max_leaf=0x0 priv_high=0x0 isolation_priv=false config_a=0x0 config_b=0x0 (stated by the hypervisor, CPUID) -> hv_isolation=n/a paravisor=n/a
+--- PASS: TestHvIsolationReadsHere (0.00s)
+PASS
+ok  	enclave.host/isolation/m3/monitor	0.003s
+
+## local suites on 0d14db23 (judge: d1 cf640825 judge-hv.mjs; node tree cf640825)
+HVLAB-CHECK ALL PASS
+HVLAB-CHECK PASS WITH 4 SKIPPED (one domain)
+HVLAB-ROUTE ALL PASS
+HVLAB-NODE ALL PASS
+TEST-HV-LOCAL PASS
+accept: 27 PASS; TEST-HV-ACCEPT PASS (QEMU/KVM, NOT Hyper-V)
+PASS clean: MON ready control_port=9000 snp=false transport=virtio
+PASS smbios: MON ERROR refusing to start: the kernel command line is not the pinned one (got "console=ttyS0 rdinit=/init loglevel=3 report_host=9001 injected=1")
+PASS addon: MON ERROR refusing to start: the boot stub added files under /.extra (credentials or extensions): /.extra/os-release /.extra/credentials /.extra/credentials/x.cred
+PASS loadopts: MON ERROR refusing to start: the kernel command line is not the pinned one (got "console=ttyS0 rdinit=/init loglevel=3 report_host=9001 injected=1")
+PASS loadpinned: MON ready control_port=9000 snp=false transport=virtio
+PASS direct: MON ready control_port=9000 snp=false transport=virtio
+UEFI-GUARDS ALL PASS
+guest console (direct boot, KVM):
+MON hv hyperv=false max_leaf=0x40000001 priv_high=0x0 isolation_priv=false config_a=0x0 config_b=0x0 (stated by the hypervisor, CPUID)
+MON boundary tier=t0-hv vmpl=n/a vmpl_floor=n/a vmpl0=n/a host_excluded=no hv_isolation=n/a paravisor=n/a
+MON ready control_port=9000 snp=false transport=virtio
+
+## the probe on the box's own kernel (WSL 6.6.87.2), three hypervisor faces
+-- plain
+MON PROBE IMAGE: loading /probe.ko (this is not a production medium)
+VBSREPORT probe: one HvCallVbsVmCallReport from VTL0 (a probe image, not a production medium)
+VBSREPORT status=0xffffffffffffffff (low 16 bits: 0 = success, 2 = invalid hypercall code, 3 = invalid input, 6 = access denied)
+VBSREPORT no hypercall page: not running on Hyper-V
+MON PROBE finished: No such device
+MON hv hyperv=false max_leaf=0x40000001 priv_high=0x0 isolation_priv=false config_a=0x0 config_b=0x0 (stated by the hypervisor, CPUID)
+-- hv
+MON PROBE IMAGE: loading /probe.ko (this is not a production medium)
+VBSREPORT probe: one HvCallVbsVmCallReport from VTL0 (a probe image, not a production medium)
+VBSREPORT status=0xffffffffffffffff (low 16 bits: 0 = success, 2 = invalid hypercall code, 3 = invalid input, 6 = access denied)
